e. Every player of a club moves by one whole number and its best few by one more, held to 1–99 and never past a teammate rated above him, whichever brings the club nearest its target: −4 to +4 points this season. The results count twice, by design: the credit's points for and against place a club's players at their positions and weigh its offence against its defence, and the move then sets the club's level from its margins, wherever the credit left it. Facts from Pro Football Archives; the weights tuned once on 2001–2005 against the next season's Madden launch ratings, then frozen."},"map":"nfl1980","clubs":[{"id":"nfl-detroit-lions","name":"Detroit Lions","code":"DET","league":"NFL","country":"840","col":"oklch(0.72 0.16 263)","str":82.7,"squad":[["Eric Hipple","QB",78],["Gary Danielson","QB",69],["Billy Sims","RB",94],["Dexter Bussey","RB",81],["Freddie Scott","WR",85],["Leonard Thompson","WR",80],["Mark Nichols","WR",67],["Tracy Porter","WR",63],["David Hill","TE",78],["Ulysses Norris","TE",63],["Amos Fowler","OL",89],["Homer Elias","OL",89],["Karl Baldischwiler","OL",89],["Keith Dorney","OL",89],["Russ Bolinger","OL",89],["Larry Lee","OL",53],["Tom Turnure","OL",53],["Dave Pureifory","DL",90],["Doug English","DL",88],["Bubba Baker","DL",81],["William Gay","DL",80],["Curtis Green","DL",66],["Steve Furness","DL",63],["Garry Cobb","LB",88],["Stan White","LB",84],["Ken Fantetti","LB",74],["Wayne Smith","CB",74],["James Hunter","CB",71],["Hector Gray","CB",64],["Jeff Delaney","CB",55],["Jimmy Allen","S",88],["Ray Oldham","S",72],["Alvin Hall","S",58],["Eddie Murray","K",94]]},{"id":"nfl-philadelphia-eagles","name":"Philadelphia Eagles","code":"PHI","league":"NFL","country":"840","col":"oklch(0.72 0.16 109)","str":82.5,"squad":[["Ron Jaworski","QB",84],["Joe Pisarcik","QB",55],["Wilbert Montgomery","RB",96],["Hubie Oliver","RB",78],["Harold Carmichael","WR",93],["Charlie Smith","WR",80],["Rodney Parker","WR",69],["Wally Henry","WR",68],["Keith Krepfle","TE",80],["John